      "content": "thanks for the clarification. i guess i'm just worried about how messy this gets if they try to come after me. do they ever actually sue for this, or is it mostly just a theoretical threat to keep people in line? it feels like a very gray area where they could just claim anything i do is a violation if they feel like it.",
